From 361e214c63065a6320d9b97766911c87b8257998 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Majid Arasskhani <M.Arasskhani@gosilkroad.net>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 20:10:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/11] refactor: one definition each for the OpenRouter base
 URL, RRF_K, the ACL constraint, outbound timeouts and system defaults
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- app/core/constants.py: `OPENROUTER_API_BASE`, `OPENROUTER_HOST`,
  `normalize_openrouter_base_url()` and `RRF_K`. Seven modules carried
  their own copy of the "admins save https://openrouter.ai, force the API
  root" normaliser with three slightly different behaviours; model_sync,
  proxy generation lookup, video, speech, transcription, images and
  provider reconciliation now share one. Behaviour change is limited to
  the two copies that did *not* redirect a bare `https://openrouter.ai`
  host (model_sync, video) — they now do, like the rest.
- models/agent.py uses `one_acl_target_constraint()` from models/knowledge
  instead of re-spelling the four-way CHECK; the constraint name and SQL
  are unchanged (verified on the mapped table).
- Outbound HTTP ceilings become Settings with the literal they replace as
  default: PROVIDER_HTTP_TIMEOUT_SECONDS (60: catalog sync, video,
  Replicate), PROVIDER_LOOKUP_TIMEOUT_SECONDS (20: reconciliation,
  generation lookup, SSRF-guarded fetches), IDENTITY_HTTP_TIMEOUT_SECONDS
  (20: SAML metadata, OIDC client — was 15 there), SPEECH_HTTP_TIMEOUT_SECONDS
  (120). Documented in .env.example. Infra-internal timeouts (Redis, S3,
  ClamAV, LDAP, sandbox broker) stay literal on purpose.
- `global_default_chat_model` and `global_default_transcription_model` are
  folded into `system_default_models`, which already owned every other
  kind: the setting keys, `model_supports_text_chat/transcription` and a
  new `get_default_model(db, kind)` live there; transcription_service and
  admin.py call the registry. The chat-default test is rewritten against
  the registry API on the shared `db_session` fixture.

Verified: 1371 passed, ruff/format/vulture clean, mypy baseline unchanged.

